{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e5109db79f6522ffe0afd12e47258e0e5a04c8bb7132efcb0a7e9a4b59db5ecb", "ja": "（今日は『屋根裏の道化師』の、完成披露試写会だ。\n出演者たちが、舞台挨拶することになっている……）", "zh": "（今天是《阁楼里的小丑》的首映会。\n演员们将上台与观众致意……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "816c96a5204bcbd51beecd599b9dfbc436f3ed8faa3af583872e32feeea9dde0", "ja": "えっと、司会者さんから紹介があって……\n次に、順番に質問が……あ、{$P$}。", "zh": "呃，首先是主持人开始介绍……\n接下来是轮流提问……啊，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a30f499ec174026e64b340c5b20f75c4909d457504609d146a789b00f11bbf64", "ja": "お疲れさま、琴葉。段取りの確認中か？", "zh": "辛苦了，琴叶。你在确认流程吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "ee927a989fc1b2aee7f21fb3b3147261b49749bdfb85833513ec40db96ebf2f3", "ja": "はい。ちゃんと、事前に\nたしかめておかないと、不安で……。", "zh": "是的，因为不事先确认的话，\n我会不放心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "26bc55b46c07a0d183122a40e303378a949ad067cefe2054e5deb922174d61a7", "ja": "やっぱり、舞台上でも立ち位置を\n確認しておいたほうがいいかな。でも……。", "zh": "我看，上舞台之前还是先\n确认一下站位会比较好，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1005_p", "source_sha256": "28a0a7930a2c5fac09bb951f03938d8c2939aa582d0e6eb67f2e1ea387bcf653", "ja": "そんなに心配しなくても、大丈夫じゃないか？\n劇場のみんなも一緒なんだし……。", "zh": "用不着这么担心吧？\n剧场的其他伙伴也会一起上台啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1006_p", "source_sha256": "05418da9ed30117378fc364b84efb0dfa016ada63eed4d10fee2dee19c4089ca", "ja": "いつもどおりにしていれば、上手くやれるよ。", "zh": "只要像平常一样发挥，一定能顺利结束的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "df4f48acd14fdd800caf11d5865a4e4c828e238872235709eab83feeb1aef8a1", "ja": "そ、そうですよね。\nみんなも一緒なんだし……あっ！", "zh": "说、说得也是。\n大家也会一起……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1008_p", "source_sha256": "402a5333214c1dacf7d3e3701ef709dceeb864a7ed99727094c396bf0efac1f1", "ja": "琴葉？", "zh": "琴叶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "619e59ddae51622539eb80c8426877ba98ed8f314faba54cab426d9db578ce4b", "ja": "すみません、{$P$}。\n私、自分の不安にみんなを付き合わせようとして……。", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}。\n我居然想劳烦大家来减轻我的不安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "5e835845b4339e4d78f552570838048d2244ef779bc82d45844237716a1ccfef", "ja": "今からこんなことじゃ、ダメですよね。\nしっかりしなきゃ……。", "zh": "都这个时候了，我这样子是不行的。\n得振作点才可以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1011_p", "source_sha256": "13bbe5c7984f4b8e7fe48698cd0c591237316128da3064aa307c586a345c8e6e", "ja": "いや、そんなに重く考えなくても……。\nお客さんが楽しんでくれたら、それが一番だよ。", "zh": "等等，你不用想得这么严重……\n让观众看得开心才是最重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "e110fe210cae6531de3a1bfb26b2738f6ac1db351d1d598d1bd1673a12f752c2", "ja": "そ、そうですよね。\nお客さんが……楽しんで、くれれば……。", "zh": "说、说得也是。\n只要观众……看得、开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1013_p", "source_sha256": "83da36cecdeefe3ae9d69835a4021ccda090450d3223cab55db324c7a87c7b82", "ja": "……琴葉？", "zh": "……琴叶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "208e223f00c1b610016a3c20dbf2e53fc588a56690849bf67db0d8b05921a174", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。今回の映画は、\nみなさんに楽しんでもらえるでしょうか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。\n这次的电影，大家看了真的会开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4f26a52c24cca631bb24daf715285f4239afd53090fa9effadf458a424b5a5d8", "ja": "もちろん、そのために努力してきたからな。\n琴葉は違うのか？", "zh": "当然会啊，你们就是为此而不断努力的。\n难道琴叶不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "0287488c6296f4a0c0d4e5468a7b045b5477405d1a5767a80b86257cadc945f0", "ja": "い、いえ！　私も、そのためにがんばりました。\nただ、今回の作品は、今までとだいぶ違うので……。", "zh": "怎、怎么会！我也为此付出很多努力。\n只是，这次的作品风格跟以往大相迳庭……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "4ecd01a01261b20085b5408af2f238459fad7db87e6e58bbef6babc2007756b7", "ja": "だから、もしかしたら……ファンの方たちを、\n幻滅させてしまうかもしれないと思って。", "zh": "所以，我很担心……\n会不会让粉丝失望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1018_p", "source_sha256": "49139f4f3c28ac4a5110dbf2c1c528ea44d62a6a807be850ba37a9b0e2ce44c5", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、琴葉。琴葉が一生懸命考えて演じたんだ。\nそんな事で、ファンの人たちが離れると思うか？", "zh": "放心吧，琴叶，你可是拿出了浑身本领来扮演这个角色。\n你觉得粉丝会因为这点小事就离开你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1019_p", "source_sha256": "dbf20fcb482dda61a9ee223b46afddd2d45fd67e07a8640a15c28f2b99980103", "ja": "そうだな。今までの琴葉を知らない人が、初めて\nこの映画を見たら、違うイメージを抱くかもしれない。", "zh": "不然换个说法，如果还不认识琴叶的人先看了这部电影，\n也许会对你抱有不同的印象吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "a9df218d06ac6966b30098c7d7e8280cb1f0a315cf2dd8d4067c95f8174f3a74", "ja": "そう……ですよね……。", "zh": "你说得……没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1021_p", "source_sha256": "ee6284cc4f6f23067828521ebde9c3d95791820765503e39f11adef66af1e016", "ja": "でもそれは、琴葉が役になりきれていた証拠だ。\nだから、自信を持っていいんだよ。", "zh": "不过，那就是琴叶彻底融入角色的证明。\n所以，你对自己要有信心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "996480d2bc3db9b87796eddd10828c158501061ea581d306b75b69460d13095b", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nあ、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n谢、谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "37a866df3207d15c361145bccd7f212b1762ccdf18cc94c5378f87bfd739a32b", "ja": "私、{$P$}に甘えてばかりですね。\n稽古のときも、ワガママを言ったりして……。", "zh": "我实在很依赖{$P$}呢。\n就连练习的时候，也老是提出任性的要求……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1024_p", "source_sha256": "11a2ce5f05749bcea95cccb282fddf3710f696a8e9d2f18c91e03fa91e191526", "ja": "いや、それだけ真剣に取り組んでいたんだ。\nむしろありがたいよ。", "zh": "不，那表示你很认真投入，\n这反而让我觉得很感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1025_p", "source_sha256": "80a22baab522887c6d63c2e8761aa82c9efed218fd7602f3966dc2108ddfb66d", "ja": "琴葉とお芝居できて、みんな楽しかったみたいだしな。\n桃子なんか、ずっと上機嫌だったし……。", "zh": "而且大家似乎也都觉得和琴叶演戏很开心。\n像桃子她在拍摄时，心情一直都很棒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1026_017kth", "source_sha256": "ad4bceeaa9987fbb0f7cf471657ab7817249e7d24f9466a911f2b01cd2238499", "ja": "それは……素直にうれしいです。\n私も、桃子ちゃんと共演できて楽しかったです。", "zh": "听到你这么说……让我觉得很高兴。\n能和桃子同台演出，我也很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1027_017kth", "source_sha256": "e544efd7ffc79b86ac67608cdcf48e3244dddc5682f2aeaabd7136b5f854eb31", "ja": "このみさんやまつりちゃん、瑞希ちゃんは頼もしくて。\n紬ちゃんは、一生懸命で……。", "zh": "木实姊、茉莉、瑞希都很可靠，\n小䌷也非常认真……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1028_p", "source_sha256": "dfb4f3ff42aa0685cc6fa6c72727a8c6eb73ed49d0e4d644b3b4f667da51b547", "ja": "うん。\n舞台挨拶も、そんな感じでやったらどうだ？", "zh": "嗯。\n待会就照这种感觉上台致意如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1029_017kth", "source_sha256": "9ac6860c7ad8a16dfbdca397519d3980634b0e4aa5dd295059383abbd68d2967", "ja": "え？　あ……そうですね。\n……どうすればいいか、わかりました。", "zh": "咦？啊……说得也是。\n……我知道该怎么做了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0073_1030_017kth", "source_sha256": "37a0a4587de155227467d88ca226553d9a445fa28b21c13419ac13c444c916f4", "ja": "私なりに、楽しんできます。\nありがとうございました、{$P$}！", "zh": "我会用自己的方式乐在其中的。\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
